# Retail Intelligence 360

**E-Commerce Sales, Customer, Seller & Fulfillment Analytics**

Turning public e-commerce data into actionable business decisions using Excel, SQL, Python and Power BI.

## Project Overview

This project analyzes the Olist Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset to explore sales performance, customer behaviour, seller performance, reviews and delivery operations.

## Tools & Technologies

- Python
- Jupyter Notebook
- PostgreSQL
- SQL
- Microsoft Excel
- Power BI
- Git and GitHub

## Project Status

Project setup and data preparation.

## Dataset

Olist Brazilian E-Commerce Public Dataset. Dataset attribution and licensing details will be documented before publication.

## Repository Structure

Project folders and documentation will be added as development progresses.
